'''Silver Snowcannon''' is a [[Unique Weapons|unique]] gun obtained by finishing second on the tokens collecting leaderboard {{Currency|Snow Token}} during the [[Christmas Event 2025]].

== Appearance ==
It has the same mesh as the godly variant of [[Snowcannon]], but it's color scheme has been altered to silver colors.

== Trivia ==
* It has [[Red Snowcannon|red]], [[Bronze Snowcannon|bronze]] and [[Gold Snowcannon|gold]] variants.
* Like all the other [[Unique Weapons|unique weapons]] (Except [[Corrupt]]), this item is [[Trading|untradable]].

* The sole owner of this weapon [https://www.roblox.com/users/401402892/profile Nathiyus].

